      "uid": "zhcn:158284f6857fe5f59bc7f7ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是的。一般来说，在后冠路线上活跃的赛马娘，\n大多会以贴近每一个人的方式，来培育后辈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38336ce593c6906c4aac5c022eb5a5f54a13f5ca891efdc921663c8febd8a00f",
