    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36ef7f82352b832c8b2acd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534a837b2707fcad960031b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量、空中救世主同学、勇敢之心同学――\n听说那些在选拔赛中与她同场奔跑的赛马娘也将踏上后冠路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db90e5a6993260a9956546ec4d3841761366b0d4df51f7ac611b2879cada12fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ca7611c4caf49538caf7f0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca0933212d477da5e9536cfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你想让西沙里奥实现梦想对吧？\n支持她不就好了。作为训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e32db76c6d59d23cfe41874e72955cece68867da06bab4cf833922e3a1dce2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bb63b666cc4f16ceaf6f33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这番话从其他训练员那里听说了。挡在前的障碍很高。\n仿佛在考验我们『是否能展现足以成为』基石，的器量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7d7ca9da2cfe51ea0917793857a1300e989a4ac75d85444e7d29c93821b3e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:946fc792e6ceaed03ddb4a2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定让你摘下后冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1dcb829a142b92cb9b9ca308b68c572271fae09491df96604d4d2bf5a7f5b8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:581b6218c0a9814e2d03ad6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定让你摘下后冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1dcb829a142b92cb9b9ca308b68c572271fae09491df96604d4d2bf5a7f5b8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8257a607d7cba5023d6b6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但不必畏缩。只要让西沙里奥从『老师』那里继承的奔跑，\n在比赛中绽放为胜利就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cb76636ceaef5ef5f950676e51c768642296765dd67e3780d6632152e09a7ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49194406d02218b0e0a9eb1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
