      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c651eb8ea2cf4a0761f187b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。首先这3年，请多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffbe666f0183dc16b30615db70494111a7de8c57ecfea14a6924b9d4f15d3699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8650b1286c8784f11e64d41b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当心意彼此相通时，恋爱戏剧便迎来大团圆。\n然而西沙里奥的故事才刚刚开始。来吧，拉开帷幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9924b2cc30450988e2bc21467cf3c19f58eed2f42f0a4ab74c5f8db224612c58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a405bfa29dbef31828be890f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "关键是她能不能接受……",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e9c5a04d7abc78110043246c8dad7aab041ec130fa28a0123d3860bccba903",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b96ea9d03303e3f203c204",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a639ab7c9b504d1952d105a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以你这般投入的程度，资格已经绰绰有余。\n只要将全部心意，原原本本地传达给西沙里奥就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ff860b1cd48e325c62a3cd0d77ae40e340be7d2b53a33a88e44e6bda75f70e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16b2856bf2dc67e044b071b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "资深训练员B",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4df92ed2a7c596de1ab1aead46e4c6d69f9bc4859a1aa0a600d279bf3a7db93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f127f3d42f65b5c40a6f911",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥同学，请让我成为你的担当训练员！\n后冠路线我有经验。绝对不会让你后悔的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1611d40df48817f64a5e4c96ae8215c55407a2f1817c9c38d29d5c22473981d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5034ae6ccb7ba6707435307",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很多训练员都费尽心思想要赢得她的心。\n但即使是经验丰富的资深训练员，也没有成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "890beabf4e9831e79f23876a4e7634688c6aa6b40a4e44720a498d6f9895c12a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ad92580087d1c437706dfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我必须更深入地了解西沙里奥。\n为了成为她真正寻求的『搭档』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2367745384448ca38f23348b33fd3da7222b92c13bf67ef3f79ad93718f2e7d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7134b39180af466070062f62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与其做愚蠢的智者，不如做明智的傻瓜",
      "source_fingerprint": "994dd5b6c019ea8de9e6ba4bcedc4b7b95b649a67fd3bc2b1ebf153263923975",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d885c5b6e8bbe28149e4b414",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『备受关注的赛马娘与训练员的学园生活』啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "667e73efc39febbe02de4f9bb6be5cc05adcf4224f8c3ff20fd9e351e8f097c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
